tions. ADA compliant with wheelchair-accessible height options. Supports multiple languages and integrates with building management systems for real-time tenant updates.\", \"sku\": \"BL-WF-DIR01\", \"brand\": {\"@type\": \"Brand\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\"}, \"manufacturer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/interactive-directory-kiosk\", \"category\": \"signage-solutions\", \"image\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/brightluxx/site-images/prod_interactive-directory-kiosk.webp\", \"offers\": {\"@type\": \"AggregateOffer\", \"priceCurrency\": \"USD\", \"lowPrice\": 500, \"highPrice\": 15000, \"offerCount\": 1, \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\", \"seller\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/interactive-directory-kiosk\"}, \"additionalProperty\": [{\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Pixel Pitch\", \"value\": \"N/A (LCD Touch)\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Brightness\", \"value\": \"500 nits\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Warranty\", \"value\": \"3 Years Standard | 5 Years Extended Available\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What are the screen size options for the Interactive Directory Kiosk?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The kiosk is available in 43-inch and 55-inch touchscreen displays, providing clear and bright visuals suitable for various environments.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Does the touchscreen support multi-touch functionality?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, it features a PCAP 10-point multi-touch screen, enabling multiple users to interact simultaneously or perform complex gestures.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is the directory software included, and what features does it offer?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, the kiosk comes with integrated wayfinding software that includes 2D and 3D maps, tenant search capabilities, and turn-by-turn directions to assist visitors effectively.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can the kiosk accommodate multiple languages for diverse users?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Absolutely. The software supports multi-language options, allowing customization to suit the demographic needs of any location.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What are the installation requirements and is it ADA compliant?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The kiosk is freestanding with steel powder-coated enclosures and offers ADA-compliant options such as wheelchair-accessible height settings, ensuring it meets accessibility standards during installation.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does this product integrate with existing building systems?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"It supports integration with Building Management Systems and tenant databases, enabling real-time updates and seamless operation within your facility.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What warranty and after-sales support does Brightluxx provide for this product?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Brightluxx offers a comprehensive warranty covering hardware and software components, along with dedicated customer support to ensure optimal performance throughout its lifecycle.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does the Interactive Directory Kiosk compare with traditional static directories?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Unlike static directories, this kiosk offers dynamic, touch-enabled navigation with real-time tenant updates, multi-language support, and ADA compliance, significantly enhancing user experience.\"}}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Home\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Products\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Interactive Directory Kiosk\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/interactive-directory-kiosk\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Organization\", \"@id\": \"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"legalName\": \"Brightluxx LED Displays\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\", \"addressLocality\": \"Dubai\", \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"}, \"contactPoint\": {\"@type\": \"ContactPoint\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"contactType\": \"sales\", \"areaServed\": [\"AE\", \"SA\", \"QA\", \"KW\", \"BH\", \"OM\"], \"availableLanguage\": [\"en\", \"ar\"]}}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"LocalBusiness\", \"@id\": \"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx LED Displays\", \"image\": \"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"priceRange\": \"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\u00b2\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\", \"addressLocality\": \"Dubai\", \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"}, \"geo\": {\"@type\": \"GeoCoordinates\", \"latitude\": 24.9857, \"longitude\": 55.0272}, \"openingHoursSpecification\": {\"@type\": \"OpeningHoursSpecification\", \"dayOfWeek\": [\"Monday\", \"Tuesday\", \"Wednesday\", \"Thursday\", \"Friday\", \"Saturday\"], \"opens\": \"09:00\", \"closes\": \"18:00\"}, \"areaServed\": [\"Dubai\", \"Abu Dhabi\", \"United Arab Emirates\", \"Saudi Arabia\", \"Qatar\", \"Kuwait\", \"Bahrain\", \"Oman\"]}</script><div><h1>Interactive Directory Kiosk</h1><p>Upgrade your building navigation with our Interactive Directory Kiosk in Dubai. Contact Brightluxx for innovative digital signage solutions across UAE!</p><p><strong>Touchscreen directory with maps and tenant listings.</strong></p><p>Freestanding interactive directory kiosk with 43&quot; or 55&quot; touchscreen. Built-in wayfinding software with 3D maps, tenant search, and turn-by-turn directions. ADA compliant with wheelchair-accessible height options. Supports multiple languages and integrates with building management systems for real-time tenant updates.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What are the screen size options for the Interactive Directory Kiosk?</h3><p>The kiosk is available in 43-inch and 55-inch touchscreen displays, providing clear and bright visuals suitable for various environments.</p><h3>Does the touchscreen support multi-touch functionality?</h3><p>Yes, it features a PCAP 10-point multi-touch screen, enabling multiple users to interact simultaneously or perform complex gestures.</p><h3>Is the directory software included, and what features does it offer?</h3><p>Yes, the kiosk comes with integrated wayfinding software that includes 2D and 3D maps, tenant search capabilities, and turn-by-turn directions to assist visitors effectively.</p><h3>Can the kiosk accommodate multiple languages for diverse users?</h3><p>Absolutely. The software supports multi-language options, allowing customization to suit the demographic needs of any location.</p></div></main><!--