: \"The kiosk is available in 43-inch and 55-inch touchscreen displays, providing clear and bright visuals suitable for various environments.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Does the touchscreen support multi-touch functionality?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, it features a PCAP 10-point multi-touch screen, enabling multiple users to interact simultaneously or perform complex gestures.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is the directory software included, and what features does it offer?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, the kiosk comes with integrated wayfinding software that includes 2D and 3D maps, tenant search capabilities, and turn-by-turn directions to assist visitors effectively.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can the kiosk accommodate multiple languages for diverse users?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Absolutely. The software supports multi-language options, allowing customization to suit the demographic needs of any location.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What are the installation requirements and is it ADA compliant?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The kiosk is freestanding with steel powder-coated enclosures and offers ADA-compliant options such as wheelchair-accessible height settings, ensuring it meets accessibility standards during installation.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does this product integrate with existing building systems?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"It supports integration with Building Management Systems and tenant databases, enabling real-time updates and seamless operation within your facility.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What warranty and after-sales support does Brightluxx provide for this product?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Brightluxx offers a comprehensive warranty covering hardware and software components, along with dedicated customer support to ensure optimal performance throughout its lifecycle.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does the Interactive Directory Kiosk compare with traditional static directories?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Unlike static directories, this kiosk offers dynamic, touch-enabled navigation with real-time tenant updates, multi-language support, and ADA compliance, significantly enhancing user experience.\"}}]}5:[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"data-testid\":\"next-server-rendered-parity-page\",\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"script\",\"0\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$f\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"1\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$10\"}}],\"$L11\",\"$L12\",\"$L13\"],\"$L14\"]}]\n11:[\"$\",\"script\",\"2\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"BreadcrumbList\\\", \\\"itemListElement\\\": [{\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 1, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Home\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 2, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Products\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/products\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 3, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Interactive Directory Kiosk\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/products/interactive-directory-kiosk\\\"}]}\"}}]\n12:[\"$\",\"script\",\"3\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"Organization\\\", \\\"@id\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx\\\", \\\"legalName\\\": \\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"logo\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\", \\\"