p><strong>Touchscreen directory with maps and tenant listings.</strong></p><p>Freestanding interactive directory kiosk with 43&quot; or 55&quot; touchscreen. Built-in wayfinding software with 3D maps, tenant search, and turn-by-turn directions. ADA compliant with wheelchair-accessible height options. Supports multiple languages and integrates with building management systems for real-time tenant updates.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What are the screen size options for the Interactive Directory Kiosk?</h3><p>The kiosk is available in 43-inch and 55-inch touchscreen displays, providing clear and bright visuals suitable for various environments.</p><h3>Does the touchscreen support multi-touch functionality?</h3><p>Yes, it features a PCAP 10-point multi-touch screen, enabling multiple users to interact simultaneously or perform complex gestures.</p><h3>Is the directory software included, and what features does it offer?</h3><p>Yes, the kiosk comes with integrated wayfinding software that includes 2D and 3D maps, tenant search capabilities, and turn-by-turn directions to assist visitors effectively.</p><h3>Can the kiosk accommodate multiple languages for diverse users?</h3><p>Absolutely. The software supports multi-language options, allowing customization to suit the demographic needs of any location.</p>14:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$15\"}}]\nb:[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]\n8:null\nd:[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"Interactive Directory Kiosk | Touchscreen LED Displays Dubai | Brightluxx\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Upgrade your building navigation with our Interactive Directory Kiosk in Dubai. Contact Brightluxx for innovative digital signage solutions across UAE!\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"2\",{\"rel\":\"canonical\",\"href\":\"https://brightluxx.com/products/interactive-directory-kiosk